# Venue preview (M4-VENUE-02): on the COURT page, VENUE AUTO -> SUNSET
# (Left wraps) loads behind the page once the cursor rests (about 25
# frames of fade, no ambience). LAKESIDE, scrolled past, loads nothing;
# PARK, rested on, loads. Back to SUNSET, then Y restores AUTO (PARK), and
# closing loads its ambience only if it changed.
70 71 up       # wraps past MODIFIERS and OPTIONS (ADR-065)
75 76 up
80 81 up
85 86 up       # past STORY (ADR-077)
100 101 start
120 121 left   # SUNSET
shot 135       # still the park: the cursor hasn't rested
shot 190       # SUNSET behind the page
200 201 left   # LAKESIDE
206 207 left   # PARK, before LAKESIDE rests
shot 220       # still SUNSET
shot 280       # PARK
290 291 right  # LAKESIDE
296 297 right  # SUNSET
shot 360       # SUNSET
370 371 y      # back to AUTO: PARK
shot 430
